OL,3,GNEWSADealer jailed for firearms and
OL,4,Adrug offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer who was found to be
OL,7,Fcarrying a rifle and ammunition when he
OL,8,Fwas arrested has been jailed for nine
OL,9,Fyears and four months at Bristol Crown
OL,10,FCourt.
OL,12,FEllis Kow, 25, from Courtney Way in
OL,13,FKingswood was arrested at his home in
OL,14,FMarch.
OL,16,FWhen arrested, police found over nine
OL,17,Fkilos of heroin and two kilos of
OL,18,Fcocaine in his cars, along with
OL,19,Fdesigner clothes, bags, trainers and a
OL,20,FRolex watch at his house.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
