OL,3,GNEWSADealer jailed for firearms and
OL,4,Adrug offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Adam Smith from the South
OL,7,FWest Regional Organised Crime Unit
OL,8,Fsaid: "Kow was a key figure in a
OL,9,Fsophisticated organised crime group
OL,10,Fresponsible for supplying large
OL,11,Fquantities of drugs across our region."
